le=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_pea_in_a_haystack.\" title=\"A pea in a haystack.\">A pea in a haystack.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_dong_and_the_gong.\" title=\"The dong and the gong.\">The dong and the gong.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Little_polythene_grief_cave.\" title=\"Little polythene grief cave.\">Little polythene grief cave.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_very_nuanced_character.\" title=\"A very nuanced character.\">A very nuanced character.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The F.I.P.</strong></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The F.I.P.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/The_F.I.P..png/revision/latest?cb=20210120074047\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The F.I.P.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/The_F.I.P..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210120074047\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/The_F.I.P..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210120074047 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c8/The_F.I.P..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210120074047 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The F.I.P.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_F.I.P..png\" data-image-name=\"The F.I.P..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_3\" title=\"Series 3\">3</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Beckett\" title=\"Rob Beckett\">Rob Beckett</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_very_nuanced_character.\" title=\"A very nuanced character.\">A very nuanced character.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_fat_bald_white_man.\" title=\"A fat bald white man.\">A fat bald white man.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The F.I.P.</b></i> is the fifth and final episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_3\" title=\"Series 3\">Series 3</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 1 November 2016. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Beckett\" title=\"Rob Beckett\">Rob Beckett</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_F.I.P.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"The F.I.P.\" was an initialism coined by <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> for \"Farty Ice Pop\", a nickname given to <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Beckett\" title=\"Rob Beckett\">Rob Beckett</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Move_the_water_from_bucket_A_to_bucket_B\" title=\"Move the water from bucket A to bucket B\">Move the water from bucket A to bucket B</a> task. The title card references <a href=\"/wiki/Place_one_or_more_doughnuts_on_your_stick\" title=\"Place one or more doughnuts on your stick\">Place one or more doughnuts on your stick</a>, and is the first episode to reference a live task in its title card.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_F.I.P.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'FIP'en', which translates as 'The F.I.P.'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'P.M.J.'. 'P.M.J.' is likely an abbreviation of 'Pieruisa mehujää', a rough translation of 'Farty ice pop'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_F.I.P.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Al_Murray\" title=\"Al Murray\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Al Murray</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Dave_Gorman\" title=\"Dave Gorman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Dave Gorman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Chowdhry\" title=\"Paul Chowdhry\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Chowdhry</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Beckett\" title=\"Rob Beckett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rob Beckett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sara_Pascoe\" title=\"Sara Pascoe\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sara Pascoe</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_photo_of_the_most_handsome_relative\" title=\"The photo of the most handsome relative\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The photo of the most handsome relative.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Move_the_water_from_bucket_A_to_bucket_B\" title=\"Move the water from bucket A to bucket B\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Move the water from bucket A to bucket B. You must not move the buckets.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Communicate_to_your_teammates_the_names_of_these_films,_books_or_TV_programmes\" title=\"Communicate to your teammates the names of these films, books or TV programmes\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Wearing one of these hands on each of your hands at all times, communicate to your teammates the names of these films, books or TV programmes. You may not raise your voice.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Do_something_that_looks_brilliant_when_sped_up_or_slowed_down\" title=\"Do something that looks brilliant when sped up or slowed down\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do something that looks brilliant when sped up or slowed down.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Place_one_or_more_doughnuts_on_your_stick\" title=\"Place one or more doughnuts on your stick\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Place one or more doughnuts on your stick. You have 100 seconds, after which the person with the lowest unique whole number of doughnuts on their stick wins.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_F.I.P.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_3,_Episode_5_%27The_FIP%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/77/Taskmaster_-_Series_3%2C_Episode_5_%27The_FIP%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003858\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_3,_Episode_5_&#39;The_FIP&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_3,_Episode_5_&#39;The_FIP&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 3, Episode 5 &#39;The FIP&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_F.I.P.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-ic